    {
      "name": "The Night Window",
      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "gwBesTaviSorIt02",
      "img": "icons/consumables/food/bowl-ribs-meat-rice-mash-brown-white.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Between scenes, Tavi can give one group of travellers a hot meal, a wash, dry clothes and a dry bench without cost or conditions. No testimony, conversion or confession is required, and she does not ask what the job was.</p><p><strong>Upstairs is finite.</strong> The Last Kettle has a handful of temporary beds behind plain curtains. When they are full, somebody is turned away, and the Director decides who — that choice is the scene, not a die roll.</p>",
          "director": ""
        },
        "source": {
          "book": "Ghostwire Core Rulebook",
          "page": "25-opposition",
          "license": "Draw Steel Creator License"
        },
        "_dsid": "the-night-window",
